<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 0, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif" }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 80, background: '#1E4FA8', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: '0 40px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>四阶段演进：一条主线的三次转向</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#A8C2E8' }}>发展脉络</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 580, padding: '24px 40px 0 40px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
        <Box style={{ height: 112, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 8, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 22px', gap: 20 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 188, height: 84, background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 8, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 4 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>PHASE 1</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>固定基站 ISAC</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
                    为感知划出专用时频资源，以 CRB / 感知 SNR 为目标做资源分配。
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#D9534F' }}>
                    失效模式：固定 ISAC 在高动态低空目标前力不从心，尤见于覆盖边缘与盲区。
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#8B97A8', width: 70, textAlign: 'right' }}>[8][2]</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ height: 112, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 8, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 22px', gap: 20 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 188, height: 84, background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 8, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 4 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>PHASE 2</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>机动与多站协同</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
                    把「固定」变成「机动」、把「单站」变成「多站」；无人机轨迹被纳入优化变量。
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#0E3F8C' }}>
                    关键发现：感知门限升高时，无人机轨迹会自动收拢靠近基站——感知需求反向塑造网络拓扑。
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#8B97A8', width: 70, textAlign: 'right' }}>[2][11]</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ height: 112, background: '#E8EFF8', border: '1px solid #3D7BD9', borderRadius: 8, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 22px', gap: 20 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 188, height: 84, background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 8, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 4 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#A8C2E8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>PHASE 3</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>消除资源开销</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
                    不再争论「给感知分多少」，而是论证「感知根本不需要额外资源」。
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#0E3F8C' }}>
                    转折标志：零感知时频开销框架 [8]；逐子载波的 Fisher 信息判据 [4]。
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: 70, textAlign: 'right' }}>[8][4]</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ height: 112, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 8, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 22px', gap: 20 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 188, height: 84, background: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px dashed #3D7BD9', borderRadius: 8, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 4 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>PHASE 4</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>多维并行创新</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
                    波形、天线架构、外部先验、数据基础设施、安全机理五个维度同时展开。
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568' }}>
                    当前形态：UW-OCDM [6] · RAA 阵列 [10] · 数字孪生 [12] · LAMBDA 数据集 [7] · 耦合泄漏 [5]
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#8B97A8', width: 70, textAlign: 'right' }}>[6][10]</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ height: 56, background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 6, display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 22px' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#FFFFFF' }}>
                主线：<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>资源争夺 → 资源复用 → 资源免用</span>；支线：固定 → 机动 → 协同；单模态 → 多模态 / 多先验
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 40, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: '0 40px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>低空经济场景下的通感一体化（ISAC）· 文献调研</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>07 / 15</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 20 }} />
</Slide>
